    "代码将回到本轮开始前，撤销 %lld 个文件自那之后的改动。对话记录会保留，Agent 不会感知到回退，可以接着告诉它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Code will return to before this turn began, undoing changes to %1$lld file since then. The conversation is kept, the Agent won't notice the rollback, and you can tell it afterward."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Code will return to before this turn began, undoing changes to %1$lld files since then. The conversation is kept, the Agent won't notice the rollback, and you can tell it afterward."
